  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-alpha.9: TLB1 v3 single-version loader (v1/v2 assets are rejected with a diagnostic). One playback API: TimelineAsset.Load returns an interned ushort timeline index; BakedLane, Bind, Slot, and the public TimelineSet are gone; the typed pair's Advance takes the index (per-index, crowd, or TimelineAsset spelling) and folds each (index, pair) lazily on first typed use. The consumer marker is renamed ITrack. New bake seam: IBake context markers, BakeRuntime installs, and the type-agnostic Timeline.Bake(id, contexts...) pass-to-all dispatch.",
